{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-2","kind":"proposition","title":"把给定线段平移到指定点","englishTitle":"To place at a given point (as an extremity) a straight line equal to a given straight line.","book":1,"number":2,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.2","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.2/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":2,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-2@raw-b85981c1bb0718fa","contentId":"euclid-1-2","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b85981c1bb0718fac98c01cb06e27d634e6cfce21b24dea0997d68adb5bb8d50","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-2.statement","euclid-1-2.construction.1","euclid-1-2.proof.1","euclid-1-2.proof.2","euclid-1-2.construction.2","euclid-1-2.proof.3","euclid-1-2.proof.4","euclid-1-2.proof.5","euclid-1-2.proof.6","euclid-1-2.proof.7","euclid-1-2.proof.8","euclid-1-2.conclusion","euclid-1-2.historical.1","euclid-1-2.historical.2","euclid-1-2.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-2.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-2","revisionId":"euclid-1-2@raw-b85981c1bb0718fa","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a3c6c93a14dde54f10d132d448da1c6f94f8dfab6033f4617c12d884353f7e3b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To place at a given point (as an extremity) a straight line equal to a given straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在给定点(作为极限)设置一条直线,等于给定的直线。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线，线或内、或外有一点，求以点为界，作直线与元线等。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"一条直线，如果有一个点在内部或外部，找到该点的边界以画出直线和中线等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-2.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-2","revisionId":"euclid-1-2@raw-b85981c1bb0718fa","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"594a46eceeb622c6bf96c3bc7b6d42ad36adb92072eda9b515c3d38d7493514c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A be the given point, and BC the given straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A是给定点,BC是给定的直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-2.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-2","revisionId":"euclid-1-2@raw-b85981c1bb0718fa","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e6263aceb96b54b3bcf34ee2022a409da5ccad9c6c621d429860571d644fe8bb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Thus it is required to place at the point A (as an extremity) a straight line equal to the given straight line BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,要求它在A点(作为极限)设置一条直线,等于给定的直线BC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-2.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-2","revisionId":"euclid-1-2@raw-b85981c1bb0718fa","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a878b7ee24f66a0e427ebe55f7ec638c2b211574565d5d9d9f906cbca1b8f7e9","citations":["euclid-1-post-1","euclid-1-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"From the point A to the point B let the straight line AB be joined; [[Post. 1](/principles/euclid-1-post-1)] and on it let the equilateral triangle DAB be constructed. [[I. 1](/principles/euclid-1-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从A点到B点,让直线 AB合起来;在这条直线上,建造等边三角形 DAB。 [[Post. 1](/principles/euclid-1-post-1)] [[I. 1](/principles/euclid-1-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-2.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-2","revisionId":"euclid-1-2@raw-b85981c1bb0718fa","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ded59e7395585a43d3b7ed4022ad017e0430aa691af32b5523294462f7e11191","citations":["euclid-1-post-2","euclid-1-post-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the straight lines AE, BF be produced in a straight line with DA, DB; [[Post. 2](/principles/euclid-1-post-2)] with centre B and distance BC let the circle CGH be described; [[Post. 3](/principles/euclid-1-post-3)] and again, with centre D and distance DG let the circle GKL be described. [[Post. 3](/principles/euclid-1-post-3)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AE、BF直线以DA、DB直线延伸;让B中枢和BC距离的CGH圆图解;让D中枢和DG中枢GKL中枢图解。 [[Post. 2](/principles/euclid-1-post-2)] [[Post. 3](/principles/euclid-1-post-3)] [[Post. 3](/principles/euclid-1-post-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-2.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-2","revisionId":"euclid-1-2@raw-b85981c1bb0718fa","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"799cd8df6fa3a50798456fdb0cad2a80a914e76a5cf970f8ca9dee9cbcb50f23","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the point B is the centre of the circle CGH, BC is equal to BG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"B点是CGH点的中心,BC等于BG点。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-2.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-2","revisionId":"euclid-1-2@raw-b85981c1bb0718fa","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"54eaedf3e2c1736d82dd666d72a1d102c0a439249aad76333c16cd72400bc7d9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since the point D is the centre of the circle GKL, DL is equal to DG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于D点是GKL点的中心,DL点等于DG点。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-2.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-2","revisionId":"euclid-1-2@raw-b85981c1bb0718fa","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3bee684d529df9d86a6df88bff0f1718af70d6decf24fad690a2dd59d48fb079","citations":["euclid-1-cn-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And in these DA is equal to DB; therefore the remainder AL is equal to the remainder BG. [[C.N. 3](/principles/euclid-1-cn-3)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在这DA中,等于DB;因此,其余AL等于其余BG。 [[C.N. 3](/principles/euclid-1-cn-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-2.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-1-2","revisionId":"euclid-1-2@raw-b85981c1bb0718fa","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"64a3a7a4c2a201807121765a5cf98ef1bbdfbc2d25f4cc08751b13604bd51e06","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But BC was also proved equal to BG; therefore each of the straight lines AL, BC is equal to BG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BC也证明等于BG,因此,AL直线和BC直线各等于BG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-2.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-1-2","revisionId":"euclid-1-2@raw-b85981c1bb0718fa","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e1ba7aae2f43f0fe9872190bef2aa096a564de7f8617490d1878b7cdb8e0b044","citations":["euclid-1-cn-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And things which are equal to the same thing are also equal to one another; [[C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)] therefore AL is also equal to BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"等同的东西 也彼此平等, 因此AL 也等于 BC。 [[C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-2.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-1-2","revisionId":"euclid-1-2@raw-b85981c1bb0718fa","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"673cfa68378a0db0725008e0048f686f52ca67939de39ff80715ae8609d48fab","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore at the given point A the straight line AL is placed equal to the given straight line BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在给定点A时,直线AL等于给定直线BC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-2.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-2","revisionId":"euclid-1-2@raw-b85981c1bb0718fa","order":11,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c4ec7554215d9139a4b15f0189508b6eee6efdfa12271ab024eb98a0523f5185","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"(Being) what it was required to do."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"这正是所要求作的图形；作图完成。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-2.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-2","revisionId":"euclid-1-2@raw-b85981c1bb0718fa","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d72c6e124a4f9366e151a698dea9cb1f8496e049b0099924d437444b8885c491","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线，线或内、或外有一点，求以点为界，作直线与元线等。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"一条直线，如果有一个点在内部或外部，找到该点的边界以画出直线和中线等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-2.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-2","revisionId":"euclid-1-2@raw-b85981c1bb0718fa","order":13,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"529da27bb78c3bf198bfe4487dc29ec599726ae7e184740dede94391d5e2db85","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论日：丁戊、丁庚线同以丁为心、戊庚为界，故等。〈界说十五。〉于丁戊线减丁丙、丁庚线减丁甲，其所减两腰线等，则所存亦等。〈公论三。〉夫丙戊与丙乙同以丙为心、戊乙为界，亦等。〈界说十五。〉即甲庚与丙乙等。〈公论一。〉若所设甲点即在丙乙线之一界，其法尤易。假如点在丙，即以丙为心作乙戊圜，从丙至戊即所求。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在太阳上：丁戊 和 丁庚 两条线都以 丁 为中心，以 戊庚 为边界，因此它们是相等的。〈界说十五。〉 从 丁戊 线上减去 丁丙，从 丁庚 线上减去 丁甲；如果减去后的两条腰线相等，那么剩下的线也相等。〈公论三。〉 丙戊 和 丙乙 都以 丙 为中心，以 戊乙 为边界，这也是相同的。〈界说十五。〉 与 甲庚 和 丙乙 相同。〈公论一。〉 如果 甲 点集正好在 丙乙 线的边界内，方法就更简单了。如果点在 丙 上，那么使用 丙 作为中心画一条 乙戊 圆，从 丙 到 戊 即为所求。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-2.source","contentId":"euclid-1-2","revisionId":"euclid-1-2@raw-b85981c1bb0718fa","order":14,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5d1fe40d719d07788fd57344f94a60d4213b72b731c5af8369cd6384113f0207","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.2/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.2\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-2:euclid-1-post-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-2","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-2.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euc